				<description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;wp-block-heading&#34;&gt;WE ARE SARAFF GLOBAL&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The Saraff Group believes in its core values . Our approach is to be trustworthy,creative and enterprising&lt;br/&gt;“Business- The Saraff Way”&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;wp-block-heading&#34;&gt;VISION&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Striving towards Business Excellence with Social Significance by Leveraging&lt;br/&gt;Eco-Friendly Technologies and Human Capital&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;wp-block-heading&#34;&gt;VALUES&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;button data-content=&#34;Our Tradition of ethical &amp;amp; honest business conduct is the foundation of our organization.&#34; data-html=&#34;true&#34; data-popover=&#34;true&#34; disabled=&#34;disabled&#34;&gt;Uncompromising Integrity&lt;/button&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;button data-content=&#34;We constantly strive to find new &amp;amp; better ways to meet our customer&#39;s needs and exceed their expectation.&#34; data-html=&#34;true&#34; data-popover=&#34;true&#34; disabled=&#34;disabled&#34;&gt;Innovation&lt;/button&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;button data-content=&#34;We proudly uphold the value,thinking being change oriented is the key to unlock our potential.&#34; data-html=&#34;true&#34; data-popover=&#34;true&#34; disabled=&#34;disabled&#34;&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/button&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;button data-content=&#34;Excellence is achieved through an ongoing effort to improve Products,Services and Processes.&#34; data-html=&#34;true&#34; data-popover=&#34;true&#34; disabled=&#34;disabled&#34;&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/button&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;button data-content=&#34;We value global competence &amp;amp; cross-cultural skills among our employees.&#34; data-html=&#34;true&#34; data-popover=&#34;true&#34; disabled=&#34;disabled&#34;&gt;Global perspective&lt;/button&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;button data-content=&#34;The value employees brings to creating customer solutions which provides the backbone of our team’s success.&#34; data-html=&#34;true&#34; data-popover=&#34;true&#34; disabled=&#34;disabled&#34;&gt;Employee First&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
